.TH HOSTNAME 1 "2026-05-22" "hako" "hako utilities"
.SH NAME
hostname \- print the system hostname
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hostname
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B hostname
prints the name of the current host to standard output, followed by a newline.
.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
$ hostname
mybox.local
.EE
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success.
.TP
.B 1
The hostname could not be retrieved from the operating system.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR hostname (1),
.BR uname (1),
.BR hako (1)
